          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഒരിക്കലും — orikkaluṁ — \"never (with a negative verb)\". ഞാൻ ഒരിക്കലും ഇറച്ചി കഴിക്കില്ല — ñān orikkaluṁ iṟacci kaḻikkilla — \"I will never eat meat.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഒരിക്കലും (orikkaluṁ) is native Dravidian: a word for \"once\", built on oru, \"one\" (DEDR 990), with -uṁ, \"even\": with a negative verb, \"not even once\"."
